  "conversionNotes": [
    "Set Traps: 'On a score of 3+' on a D6 converted to 5+ on a D12.",
    "The Marksman equipment list's Blunderbuss and Hunting rifle spill into the second column of the printed page; I read them as part of the Marksman list (before the Armour heading), not the Scout list.",
    "Scout list items 'Longbow' (15 gc) and 'Hunting arrows' (35 gc) are Bergjaeger only; Halfling Scouts share the Scout list without them. Hunting arrows listed as misc.",
    "Item names copied as printed (lowercase 'Morning star', 'Duelling pistol', 'Mace/hammer').",
    "Skill table 'Special' column is empty for all; Bergjaeger Shooting and Speed only.",
    "Starting experience: Captain 20, Sergeant 8, Bergjaegers 4, Youngblood 0; henchmen 0.",
    "No warband-wide special rules printed; Youngblood flavour text says they may not wear the uniform until served a year (no game effect)."
  ]
